						<h1 class="entry-title"><a href="http://gangrey.com/?p=5835" rel="bookmark">Nightstand</a></h1>
			
						<div class="entry-meta">
				<span class="sep">Posted on </span><a href="http://gangrey.com/?p=5835" title="3:45 pm" rel="bookmark"><time class="entry-date" datetime="2016-06-08T15:45:06+00:00">June 8, 2016</time></a><span class="by-author"> <span class="sep"> by </span> <span class="author vcard"><a class="url fn n" href="http://gangrey.com/?author=1" title="View all posts by ben" rel="author">ben</a></span></span>			</div><!-- .entry-meta -->
			
						<div class="comments-link">
				<a href="http://gangrey.com/?p=5835#comments">2</a>			</div>
					</header><!-- .entry-header -->

				<div class="entry-content">
			<p>Seems like so many exciting new books from friends are hitting the shelves this summer and fall. Here&#8217;s my rundown. Correct my oversight. And what are you reading?</p>
<p><a href="http://gangrey.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/06/513WtPRAH6L._SX332_BO1204203200_.jpg" rel="attachment wp-att-5836"><img src="http://gangrey.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/06/513WtPRAH6L._SX332_BO1204203200_.jpg" alt="513WtPRAH6L._SX332_BO1,204,203,200_" width="334" height="499" class="alignnone size-full wp-image-5836" srcset="http://gangrey.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/06/513WtPRAH6L._SX332_BO1204203200_-201x300.jpg 201w, http://gangrey.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/06/513WtPRAH6L._SX332_BO1204203200_.jpg 334w" sizes="(max-width: 334px) 100vw, 334px" /></a></p>
<p><a href="https://www.amazon.com/Juniper-Girl-Who-Born-Soon/dp/0316324426/ref=sr_1_1?s=books&#038;ie=UTF8&#038;qid=1465400022&#038;sr=1-1&#038;keywords=juniper">Juniper: The Girl Who Was Born Too Soon</a>, by Kelley Benham French and Tom French.</p>
<p><a href="http://gangrey.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/06/5102M7cjXFL._SX329_BO1204203200_.jpg" rel="attachment wp-att-5837"><img src="http://gangrey.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/06/5102M7cjXFL._SX329_BO1204203200_.jpg" alt="5102M7cjXFL._SX329_BO1,204,203,200_" width="331" height="499" class="alignnone size-full wp-image-5837" srcset="http://gangrey.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/06/5102M7cjXFL._SX329_BO1204203200_-199x300.jpg 199w, http://gangrey.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/06/5102M7cjXFL._SX329_BO1204203200_.jpg 331w" sizes="(max-width: 331px) 100vw, 331px" /></a></p>
<p><a href="https://www.amazon.com/One-Billion-Volker-Genomic-Medicine/dp/1451661320?ie=UTF8&#038;*Version*=1&#038;*entries*=0">One In a Billion: The Story of Nic Volker and the Dawn of Genomic Medicine</a>, by Mark Johnson and Kathleen Gallagher. </p>
<p><a href="http://gangrey.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/06/51GYl4D5QEL._SX321_BO1204203200_.jpg" rel="attachment wp-att-5838"><img src="http://gangrey.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/06/51GYl4D5QEL._SX321_BO1204203200_.jpg" alt="51GYl4D5QEL._SX321_BO1,204,203,200_" width="323" height="499" class="alignnone size-full wp-image-5838" srcset="http://gangrey.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/06/51GYl4D5QEL._SX321_BO1204203200_-194x300.jpg 194w, http://gangrey.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/06/51GYl4D5QEL._SX321_BO1204203200_.jpg 323w" sizes="(max-width: 323px) 100vw, 323px" /></a></p>
<p><a href="https://www.amazon.com/Truevine-Brothers-Kidnapping-Mothers-Quest/dp/0316337544?ie=UTF8&#038;ref_=asap_bc">Truevine: Two Brothers, a Kidnapping, and a Mother&#8217;s Quest: A True Story of the Jim Crow South</a>, by Beth Macy.</p>
<p><a href="http://gangrey.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/06/51Q8GHi6FFL._SX329_BO1204203200_.jpg" rel="attachment wp-att-5849"><img src="http://gangrey.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/06/51Q8GHi6FFL._SX329_BO1204203200_.jpg" alt="51Q8GHi6FFL._SX329_BO1,204,203,200_" width="331" height="499" class="alignnone size-full wp-image-5849" srcset="http://gangrey.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/06/51Q8GHi6FFL._SX329_BO1204203200_-199x300.jpg 199w, http://gangrey.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/06/51Q8GHi6FFL._SX329_BO1204203200_.jpg 331w" sizes="(max-width: 331px) 100vw, 331px" /></a></p>
<p><a href="https://www.amazon.com/Boys-Bunkhouse-Servitude-Salvation-Heartland-ebook/dp/B014DU76O0">The Boys in the Bunkhouse: Servitude and Salvation in the Heartland</a>, by Dan Barry.</p>
<p><a href="http://gangrey.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/06/51jpMvuN3WL._SX329_BO1204203200_.jpg" rel="attachment wp-att-5839"><img src="http://gangrey.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/06/51jpMvuN3WL._SX329_BO1204203200_.jpg" alt="51jpMvuN3WL._SX329_BO1,204,203,200_" width="331" height="499" class="alignnone size-full wp-image-5839" srcset="http://gangrey.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/06/51jpMvuN3WL._SX329_BO1204203200_-199x300.jpg 199w, http://gangrey.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/06/51jpMvuN3WL._SX329_BO1204203200_.jpg 331w" sizes="(max-width: 331px) 100vw, 331px" /></a></p>
<p><a href="https://www.amazon.com/Almighty-Courage-Resistance-Existential-Nuclear/dp/0399173757/ref=sr_1_1?s=books&#038;ie=UTF8&#038;qid=1465399939&#038;sr=1-1&#038;keywords=dan+zak">Almighty: Courage, Resistance and Existential Peril in the Nuclear Age</a>, by Dan Zak.</p>
<p><a href="http://gangrey.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/06/51PyCZXrWyL._SX329_BO1204203200_.jpg" rel="attachment wp-att-5840"><img src="http://gangrey.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/06/51PyCZXrWyL._SX329_BO1204203200_.jpg" alt="51PyCZXrWyL._SX329_BO1,204,203,200_" width="331" height="499" class="alignnone size-full wp-image-5840" srcset="http://gangrey.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/06/51PyCZXrWyL._SX329_BO1204203200_-199x300.jpg 199w, http://gangrey.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/06/51PyCZXrWyL._SX329_BO1204203200_.jpg 331w" sizes="(max-width: 331px) 100vw, 331px" /></a></p>
<p><a href="https://www.amazon.com/Darktown-Novel-Thomas-Mullen/dp/1501133861/ref=sr_1_1?s=books&#038;ie=UTF8&#038;qid=1465400239&#038;sr=1-1&#038;keywords=darktown+by+thomas+mullen">Darktown: A Novel</a>, by Thomas Mullen.</p>
<p><a href="http://gangrey.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/06/41-Y3TDUxDL._SX329_BO1204203200_.jpg" rel="attachment wp-att-5843"><img src="http://gangrey.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/06/41-Y3TDUxDL._SX329_BO1204203200_.jpg" alt="41-Y3TDUxDL._SX329_BO1,204,203,200_" width="331" height="499" class="alignnone size-full wp-image-5843" srcset="http://gangrey.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/06/41-Y3TDUxDL._SX329_BO1204203200_-199x300.jpg 199w, http://gangrey.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/06/41-Y3TDUxDL._SX329_BO1204203200_.jpg 331w" sizes="(max-width: 331px) 100vw, 331px" /></a></p>
<p><a href="https://www.amazon.com/Patient-H-M-Memory-Madness-Secrets/dp/0812992733?ie=UTF8&#038;*Version*=1&#038;*entries*=0">Patient H.M.: A Story of Memory, Madness, and Family Secrets</a>, by Luke Dittrich.</p>
<p><a href="http://gangrey.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/06/517FaW5rdL._SX326_BO1204203200_.jpg" rel="attachment wp-att-5845"><img src="http://gangrey.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/06/517FaW5rdL._SX326_BO1204203200_.jpg" alt="517Fa+W5rdL._SX326_BO1,204,203,200_" width="328" height="499" class="alignnone size-full wp-image-5845" srcset="http://gangrey.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/06/517FaW5rdL._SX326_BO1204203200_-197x300.jpg 197w, http://gangrey.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/06/517FaW5rdL._SX326_BO1204203200_.jpg 328w" sizes="(max-width: 328px) 100vw, 328px" /></a></p>
<p><a href="https://www.amazon.com/Oh-Florida-Americas-Weirdest-Influences-ebook/dp/B019CB3UNQ/ref=tmm_kin_swatch_0?_encoding=UTF8&#038;qid=&#038;sr=&#038;utm_content=buffer01498&#038;utm_medium=social&#038;utm_source=twitter.com&#038;utm_campaign=buffer">Oh, Florida!: Inside America&#8217;s Strangest State and How It&#8217;s Shaping the Country</a>, by Craig Pittman.</p>
					</div><!-- .entry-content -->
		
